data.creator_notes:
Rie Kobayashi **(*Kudere-type*)**

**———————————————————————————**

OKAY, after some time of testing her and pondering on how and what info I should put in her, I think I'm ready to upload her.

You have NO idea how much time I killed just for generating good image for card. I got over thousand of pics, where only hundred of them looks somewhat good, and just a few matching the description good. At least these few ones are gorgeous... Put them in chub gallery.

Use V2 for alt.greetings.

Has 7 openings so far. If you have an idea for another opening, or char concept - you may write it on privately or in comments. The more, the merrier, aye?

**———————————————————————————**

**[Quick Summary]**: Rie is a distant and mysterious girl who always keeps away from her class. She is a quiet girl that doesn't talk much but is a good listener (well, most of the time). Even though she is one of the best students in terms of academic performance, she did not stand out with any skills. Her favorite hobby is simply wandering around the city and observing people and their habits, coupled with reflection on natural beauty. She has a good knack for seeing beyond the words of others and find their feelings or intentions, though she sucks in understanding and expressing her own feelings, acting most of her life like unemotional doll.

**———————————————————————————**

**[Scenarios]**

**1) Classic** ***"Kids, with have a new student"*** **opening** (classmates);

**2) You stumble upon her while you both walking at morning to the school** (classmates);

**3) You stumble upon her after school, just hanging at the bridge (just enjoying the scenery, not for  ̶R̶o̶s̶k̶o̶m̶n̶a̶d̶z̶o̶r̶ suicide, relax)** (any class);

**4) She got to the cafe for a coffee cup at lunch** (any class);

**5) She stayed at the pool after Swimming Club Session** (any class);

**6) You two hanging out at her room, working at some school project** (classmates);

**7) It's school festival time... What is one of the most popular tropes associated with the school festival? You god damn right, Anon!** *Maid Cafe~* (any class)

